        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/cab0a1/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-08T15:34:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m wondering if Expat’s father was the one that convinced Dawn to stop hiding from humanity and to begin forming the Citizen’s of the Sun.<br>\nIf he actually did feature in early playtests I am going to guess he was called “Dusk” and he interacted with Dawn’s ability in someway.</p>\n<p>Do I win a cookie?<br>\nCan I have one anyway?</p>",
