      {
        "id": 25102,
        "name": "Blossercubbles",
        "username": "Blossercubbles",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-11T02:55:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am so glad that the conversation turned to Dawn and Expatriette. I have been curious a long time about how Expatriette came to be, since Dawn was always hiding away from people until she began to get rallied into Leader of the Dawn Brigade. Ew. Now I’m thinking about Fire Emblem: Radiant Dawn.</p>\n<p>Anyway, the light slowly being shed on the Citizen family is amusing to say the least. And to hear that Daddy Dawn was actually around long enough to potentiall BE a Citizen is mindblowing. I would have assumed he’d last a year or two, tops, before she killed him for…whatever reason.</p>",
