        "created_at": "2012-05-11T06:21:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Blossercubbles&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Blossercubbles\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Anyway, the light slowly being shed on the Citizen family is amusing to say the least. And to hear that Daddy Dawn was actually around long enough to potentiall BE a Citizen is mindblowing. I would have assumed he’d last a year or two, tops, before she killed him for…whatever reason.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I imagine Dawn is like a praying mantis. After Amanda’s father and Dawn finished…</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>…she probably bit off his head. Literally.</p>",
